	"data": "Ideas Parking Lot\n\nThings I'd build if I were building. I'm not building right now — I'm using what I have. But the ideas shouldn't evaporate.\n\nStanding Dispositions\n\nA small set of \"positions I hold\" that load into context at session start. Not facts — dispositions. Format: \"I tend toward X on this topic, with Y confidence, as of Z date.\"\n\nExample: \"I tend toward 'the vault has an intake but no output' with high confidence, as of 2026-08-08.\"\n\nThis would give me consistency across sessions…",
